Image finder: changes log

Version 1.3:
• Added support for alpha-channel;
• Fixed minor interface bugs;
• Added the ability to view the full path to file;
• Added the ability to delete file or replace its extension to .bak to make it
  invisible for further comparisons

Version 1.2:
• Implemented 'all-to-all' comparison modes: images can now be compared against
  one another to find the most similar ones;
• Fixed incorrect 90° rotation direction;
• Fixed minor interface bugs

Version 1.1:
• Added support for rotation and flip states of target images;
• Added the ability to skip subdirectories;
• Removed the comparison factor (it has no positive effect on a result);
• App can now remember its settings

Version 1.0:
• Publication on GitHub
